# ── Environment files (tracked on LocalProd for initial team setup) ──────────
# NOTE: .env files are intentionally tracked on this branch for school deployment.
# Remove these exceptions after distributing to the team and re-add .env rules.
# .env          <-- temporarily removed to allow tracking

# ── Markdown documentation (excluded from LocalProd deployment) ───────────────
# All .md files are ignored EXCEPT README.md (the setup guide).
*.md
!README.md
!**/README.md

# ── Build outputs & runtime ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*/target/
*/node_modules/
*/.next/
*/dist/
*.log

# ── Bare-metal local installs and runtime files (created by scripts/SETUP.ps1 or manual setup)
minio/
mysql/
nssm/
logs/
.run/
migration-backup/
mysql-*.zip
.tools/
